<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="I&apos;m Waiting For The Man [Album Version (Stereo)]"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="The Velvet Underground"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Nico"/><amll:meta key="album" value="The Velvet Underground &amp; Nico 45th Anniversary"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM71211192"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="473120927"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="190055247"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="DEVILISALIE"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:27.227"><div begin="16.628" end="4:27.227"><p begin="16.628" end="20.074" itunes:key="L0" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.628" end="17.927">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="17.927" end="18.078">wai</span><span begin="18.078" end="18.382">ting</span> <span begin="18.382" end="18.563">for</span> <span begin="18.563" end="19.071">my</span> <span begin="19.071" end="20.074">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我正等我的那个人（“my man”指供毒贩，兼具对毒品病态依赖与亲密称呼的双重意味）</span></p><p begin="24.235" end="27.738" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.235" end="24.422">Twen</span><span begin="24.422" end="24.578">ty</span><span begin="24.578" end="25.149">-six</span> <span begin="25.149" end="25.357">dol</span><span begin="25.357" end="26.041">lars</span> <span begin="26.409" end="26.576">in</span> <span begin="26.576" end="26.787">my</span> <span begin="26.787" end="27.738">hand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">手里拽着二十六美元（按当年市价约可买1~1.5克海洛因，路·里德曾笑称“除了价格，歌里一切都是真的”）</span></p><p begin="31.293" end="34.312" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.293" end="31.538">Up</span> <span begin="31.538" end="31.806">to</span> <span begin="31.806" end="31.973">Le</span><span begin="31.973" end="32.205">xin</span><span begin="32.205" end="32.687">gton,</span> <span begin="33.001" end="33.147">1</span><span begin="33.147" end="33.358">-2</span><span begin="33.358" end="34.312">-5</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一路坐到列克星敦大道与125街交界（黑人聚居区的哈莱姆区地铁终点站）</span></p><p begin="34.871" end="38.500" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.871" end="35.112">Feel</span> <span begin="35.112" end="35.338">sick</span> <span begin="35.338" end="35.596">and</span> <span begin="35.596" end="35.807">dir</span><span begin="35.807" end="36.023">ty,</span> <span begin="36.023" end="36.547">more</span> <span begin="36.547" end="36.751">dead</span> <span begin="36.751" end="37.011">than</span> <span begin="37.011" end="37.236">a</span><span begin="37.236" end="38.500">live</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">戒断反应令人反胃龌龊，半死不活（海洛因毒瘾发作的剧烈痛苦）</span></p><p begin="39.688" end="42.969" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.688" end="40.820">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="40.820" end="41.070">wai</span><span begin="41.070" end="41.282">ting</span> <span begin="41.282" end="41.541">for</span> <span begin="41.541" end="42.034">my</span> <span begin="42.034" end="42.969">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我正等我的那个人</span></p><p begin="50.292" end="54.360" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.292" end="50.483">Hey,</span> <span begin="50.483" end="50.710">white</span> <span begin="50.710" end="51.279">boy,</span> <span begin="52.363" end="52.623">what</span> <span begin="52.623" end="52.853">you</span> <span begin="52.853" end="53.096">do</span><span begin="53.096" end="53.297">in&apos;</span> <span begin="53.297" end="53.517">up</span><span begin="53.517" end="54.360">town?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“嘿，白人小子，你跑这上城区干嘛？”</span></p><p begin="57.908" end="1:02.460" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.908" end="58.140">Hey,</span> <span begin="58.140" end="58.342">white</span> <span begin="58.342" end="58.902">boy,</span> <span begin="59.848" end="1:00.031">you</span> <span begin="1:00.031" end="1:00.176">cha</span><span begin="1:00.176" end="1:00.333">sin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:00.333" end="1:00.713">our</span> <span begin="1:00.713" end="1:00.881">wo</span><span begin="1:00.881" end="1:01.087">men</span> <span begin="1:01.087" end="1:01.235">a</span><span begin="1:01.235" end="1:02.460">round?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“嘿，白人小子，你是来这搭讪我们这儿的女人？”</span></p><p begin="1:05.517" end="1:08.815" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.517" end="1:05.711">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:05.711" end="1:05.834">par</span><span begin="1:05.834" end="1:05.928">don</span> <span begin="1:05.928" end="1:06.204">me,</span> <span begin="1:06.204" end="1:06.595">sir,</span> <span begin="1:06.832" end="1:07.166">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:07.166" end="1:07.269">fur</span><span begin="1:07.269" end="1:07.517">thest</span> <span begin="1:07.517" end="1:07.728">from</span> <span begin="1:07.728" end="1:07.913">my</span> <span begin="1:07.913" end="1:08.815">mind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“哦，先生抱歉，这念头离我十万八千里”（吸毒抑制性欲，亦隐喻对女性毫无兴趣）</span></p><p begin="1:09.236" end="1:12.872" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.236" end="1:09.478">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:09.478" end="1:09.749">just</span> <span begin="1:09.749" end="1:10.198">loo</span><span begin="1:10.198" end="1:10.411">kin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:10.411" end="1:10.632">for</span> <span begin="1:10.632" end="1:10.930">a</span> <span begin="1:10.930" end="1:11.149">dear,</span> <span begin="1:11.149" end="1:11.427">dear</span> <span begin="1:11.427" end="1:11.659">friend</span> <span begin="1:11.659" end="1:11.947">of</span> <span begin="1:11.947" end="1:12.872">mine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“我只是在找一位我极其亲密的好友”（极具讽刺意味，毒贩眼中他只是个送钱的瘾君子）</span></p><p begin="1:14.089" end="1:17.324" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.089" end="1:15.372">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:15.372" end="1:15.538">wai</span><span begin="1:15.538" end="1:15.769">ting</span> <span begin="1:15.769" end="1:15.976">for</span> <span begin="1:15.976" end="1:16.464">my</span> <span begin="1:16.464" end="1:17.324">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我正等我的那个人</span></p><p begin="1:24.556" end="1:28.799" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.556" end="1:24.745">Here</span> <span begin="1:24.745" end="1:25.053">he</span> <span begin="1:25.053" end="1:26.082">comes,</span> <span begin="1:26.453" end="1:26.755">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:26.755" end="1:27.208">all</span> <span begin="1:27.208" end="1:27.412">dressed</span> <span begin="1:27.412" end="1:27.888">in</span> <span begin="1:27.888" end="1:28.799">black</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他走过来了，一身黑衣打扮</span></p><p begin="1:32.222" end="1:36.479" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.222" end="1:32.652">PR</span> <span begin="1:32.652" end="1:33.602">shoes</span> <span begin="1:34.424" end="1:34.575">and</span> <span begin="1:34.575" end="1:34.849">a</span> <span begin="1:34.849" end="1:35.025">big</span> <span begin="1:35.025" end="1:35.708">straw</span> <span begin="1:35.708" end="1:36.479">hat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尖头皮鞋，戴着顶大草帽（“PR shoes”指波多黎各尖头皮鞋，亦指利于逃跑翻墙的鞋）</span></p><p begin="1:39.917" end="1:42.720" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.917" end="1:40.128">He&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:40.128" end="1:40.366">ne</span><span begin="1:40.366" end="1:40.607">ver</span> <span begin="1:40.607" end="1:40.825">ear</span><span begin="1:40.825" end="1:41.212">ly,</span> <span begin="1:41.560" end="1:41.860">he&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:41.860" end="1:42.064">al</span><span begin="1:42.064" end="1:42.281">ways</span> <span begin="1:42.281" end="1:42.720">late</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他从不提前，总是迟到（毒贩从不准时，但等待毒品者无权抱怨）</span></p><p begin="1:43.684" end="1:47.281" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.684" end="1:43.910">First</span> <span begin="1:43.910" end="1:44.141">thing</span> <span begin="1:44.141" end="1:44.383">you</span> <span begin="1:44.383" end="1:44.605">learn</span> <span begin="1:44.605" end="1:44.800">is</span> <span begin="1:44.800" end="1:45.035">that</span> <span begin="1:45.035" end="1:45.342">you</span> <span begin="1:45.342" end="1:45.597">al</span><span begin="1:45.597" end="1:45.821">ways</span> <span begin="1:45.821" end="1:46.070">got</span><span begin="1:46.070" end="1:46.299">ta</span> <span begin="1:46.299" end="1:47.281">wait</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你学会的第一件事，就是你必须永远等待</span></p><p begin="1:48.549" end="1:51.812" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.549" end="1:49.792">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:49.792" end="1:49.977">wai</span><span begin="1:49.977" end="1:50.243">ting</span> <span begin="1:50.243" end="1:50.431">for</span> <span begin="1:50.431" end="1:50.855">my</span> <span begin="1:50.855" end="1:51.812">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我正等我的那个人</span></p><p begin="1:53.747" end="1:54.787" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.747" end="1:54.021">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:54.021" end="1:54.214">work</span> <span begin="1:54.214" end="1:54.399">it</span> <span begin="1:54.399" end="1:54.787">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">噢，演奏起来吧</span></p><p begin="2:33.496" end="2:37.607" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:33.496" end="2:33.742">Up</span> <span begin="2:33.742" end="2:33.817">to</span> <span begin="2:33.817" end="2:33.963">a</span> <span begin="2:33.963" end="2:34.240">brown</span><span begin="2:34.240" end="2:34.982">stone,</span> <span begin="2:35.167" end="2:35.444">up</span> <span begin="2:35.444" end="2:35.863">three</span> <span begin="2:35.863" end="2:36.162">flights</span> <span begin="2:36.162" end="2:36.447">of</span> <span begin="2:36.447" end="2:37.607">stairs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">走上一栋赤褐色砂石建筑，爬上三层楼梯（纽约黑人区典型无电梯住宅，“brownstone”亦为海洛因别称）</span></p><p begin="2:40.943" end="2:45.086" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.943" end="2:41.052">E</span><span begin="2:41.052" end="2:41.232">very</span><span begin="2:41.232" end="2:41.392">bo</span><span begin="2:41.392" end="2:41.557">dy</span><span begin="2:41.557" end="2:41.707">-bo</span><span begin="2:41.707" end="2:41.939">dy&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:41.939" end="2:42.123">pinned</span> <span begin="2:42.123" end="2:42.656">you,</span> <span begin="2:43.387" end="2:43.644">but</span> <span begin="2:43.644" end="2:43.832">no</span><span begin="2:43.832" end="2:44.040">bo</span><span begin="2:44.040" end="2:44.219">dy</span> <span begin="2:44.219" end="2:45.086">cares</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">街坊邻居都识破了你这瘾君子，却根本无人搭理（“pinned”指瞳孔缩小/识破身份，纽约毒品泛滥的冷漠现实）</span></p><p begin="2:48.607" end="2:51.383" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.607" end="2:48.796">He&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:48.796" end="2:49.015">got</span> <span begin="2:49.015" end="2:49.187">the</span> <span begin="2:49.187" end="2:49.778">works,</span> <span begin="2:50.296" end="2:50.483">gives</span> <span begin="2:50.483" end="2:50.683">you</span> <span begin="2:50.683" end="2:50.901">sweet</span> <span begin="2:50.901" end="2:51.383">taste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他备好了注射针具，给你尝上一口甜头（“works”指注射毒品全套工具）</span></p><p begin="2:51.956" end="2:55.893" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:51.956" end="2:52.139">Ah,</span> <span begin="2:52.139" end="2:52.366">then</span> <span begin="2:52.366" end="2:52.562">you</span> <span begin="2:52.562" end="2:52.779">got</span><span begin="2:52.779" end="2:53.021">ta</span> <span begin="2:53.021" end="2:53.323">split</span> <span begin="2:53.323" end="2:53.532">be</span><span begin="2:53.532" end="2:53.750">cause</span> <span begin="2:53.750" end="2:53.992">you</span> <span begin="2:53.992" end="2:54.202">got</span> <span begin="2:54.202" end="2:54.447">no</span> <span begin="2:54.447" end="2:54.653">time</span> <span begin="2:54.653" end="2:54.936">to</span> <span begin="2:54.936" end="2:55.893">waste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">啊，接着你必须赶紧溜走，没时间在此逗留（避开警察并找地方过瘾）</span></p><p begin="2:57.114" end="3:00.302" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.114" end="2:58.317">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="2:58.317" end="2:58.570">wai</span><span begin="2:58.570" end="2:58.802">ting</span> <span begin="2:58.802" end="2:58.985">for</span> <span begin="2:58.985" end="2:59.463">my</span> <span begin="2:59.463" end="3:00.302">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我正等我的那个人（歌词重现暗示次日循环往复的吸毒日常）</span></p><p begin="3:11.602" end="3:16.008" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:11.602" end="3:11.727">Ba</span><span begin="3:11.727" end="3:11.909">by,</span> <span begin="3:11.909" end="3:12.007">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:12.007" end="3:12.228">you</span> <span begin="3:12.228" end="3:12.454">hol</span><span begin="3:12.454" end="3:12.798">ler,</span> <span begin="3:12.798" end="3:13.286">dar</span><span begin="3:13.286" end="3:13.588">lin&apos;,</span> <span begin="3:13.588" end="3:13.793">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="3:13.793" end="3:14.038">you</span> <span begin="3:14.038" end="3:14.518">bawl</span> <span begin="3:14.518" end="3:14.699">and</span> <span begin="3:14.699" end="3:16.008">shout</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">宝贝，别再大喊，亲爱的，别再大吵大闹</span></p><p begin="3:19.026" end="3:23.298" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:19.026" end="3:19.261">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="3:19.261" end="3:19.503">fee</span><span begin="3:19.503" end="3:19.721">ling</span> <span begin="3:19.721" end="3:20.227">good,</span> <span begin="3:20.929" end="3:21.093">you</span> <span begin="3:21.093" end="3:21.208">know</span> <span begin="3:21.208" end="3:21.410">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="3:21.410" end="3:21.526">gon</span><span begin="3:21.526" end="3:21.701">na</span> <span begin="3:21.701" end="3:21.865">work</span> <span begin="3:21.865" end="3:22.089">it</span> <span begin="3:22.089" end="3:22.304">on</span> <span begin="3:22.304" end="3:23.298">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我感觉爽爆了，你知道我会搞定这一切的</span></p><p begin="3:26.702" end="3:30.064" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:26.702" end="3:26.972">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="3:26.972" end="3:27.172">fee</span><span begin="3:27.172" end="3:27.336">ling</span> <span begin="3:27.336" end="3:27.812">good,</span> <span begin="3:28.132" end="3:28.327">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="3:28.327" end="3:28.529">fee</span><span begin="3:28.529" end="3:28.698">ling,</span> <span begin="3:28.698" end="3:28.894">oh,</span> <span begin="3:28.894" end="3:29.198">so</span> <span begin="3:29.198" end="3:30.064">fine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我感觉爽爆了，我感觉，哦，如此惬意</span></p><p begin="3:30.475" end="3:34.181" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:30.475" end="3:30.712">Un</span><span begin="3:30.712" end="3:30.939">til</span> <span begin="3:30.939" end="3:31.191">to</span><span begin="3:31.191" end="3:31.378">mor</span><span begin="3:31.378" end="3:31.673">row,</span> <span begin="3:31.673" end="3:31.866">but</span> <span begin="3:31.866" end="3:32.100">that&apos;s</span> <span begin="3:32.100" end="3:32.336">just</span> <span begin="3:32.336" end="3:32.569">some</span> <span begin="3:32.569" end="3:32.785">o</span><span begin="3:32.785" end="3:33.034">ther</span> <span begin="3:33.034" end="3:34.181">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">快乐持续到明天，但那又是另一码事了</span></p><p begin="3:35.224" end="3:38.404" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:35.224" end="3:36.512">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="3